{"id":"lagunas-route","title":"Lagunas Route: Uyuni to San Pedro de Atacama","who":"Classic route · the Bolivian Altiplano by bike","when":"Best April–November (dry, very cold nights)","vehicle":"Bikepacking (also motorcycle or 4x4), 7–12 days","kind":"bike","color":"#0891b2","summary":"Sandy, corrugated tracks over 4,000–5,000 m through south-west Bolivia: coloured lagoons full of flamingos, geysers, hot springs and volcanoes, then a fast drop of 2,000 m into Chile's Atacama desert. Remote and hard: carry food, water and warm clothes.","sources":[{"label":"Bikepacking.com: Lagunas y Salares route","url":"https://bikepacking.com/routes/lagunas-y-salares/"},{"label":"Itchy Boots: 10 tips for the Ruta de las Lagunas","url":"https://www.itchyboots.com/bikers-guide/10-tips-for-riding-the-ruta-de-las-lagunas-in-bolivia"}],"approximate":"The usual villages, lagoons and refuges; the tracks shift every season, so the line is a guide only.","km":562,"bbox":[-68.1922,-23.3282,-66.7182,-20.4629],"stops":[{"name":"Uyuni","place":"Uyuni, Bolivia","at":[-20.4628,-66.8239],"text":"A windy rail town at the edge of the world's biggest salt flat, and the train cemetery.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cd/Uyuni_Potosi_Ave_Aerial.jpg/500px-Uyuni_Potosi_Ave_Aerial.jpg","page":"Uyuni","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Uyuni_Potosi_Ave_Aerial.jpg","credit":"Jaimalalatete","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}},{"name":"San Cristóbal","place":"San Cristóbal, Potosí, Bolivia","at":[-21.154,-67.1662],"text":"The last reliable fuel and shops.","source":{"label":"Itchy Boots: tips","url":"https://www.itchyboots.com/bikers-guide/10-tips-for-riding-the-ruta-de-las-lagunas-in-bolivia"}},{"name":"Villa Alota","place":"Villa Alota, Bolivia","at":[-21.4039,-67.5965],"text":"A small Altiplano village with basic lodgings.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e2/Cerro_Lipez.jpg/500px-Cerro_Lipez.jpg","page":"Potosí Department","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Cerro_Lipez.jpg","credit":"Jonathan Lewis","license":"CC BY-SA 2.0"}},{"name":"Villa Mar","place":"Villa Mar, Bolivia","at":[-21.7551,-67.4815],"text":"Rock formations of the Valle de las Rocas, and llamas.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bc/Laguna_Verde_y_Blanca_desde_el_volc%C3%A1n_Licancabur_Bolivia.jpg/500px-Laguna_Verde_y_Blanca_desde_el_volc%C3%A1n_Licancabur_Bolivia.jpg","page":"Sur Lípez Province","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Laguna_Verde_y_Blanca_desde_el_volc%C3%A1n_Licancabur_Bolivia.jpg","credit":"Cristian Ordenes","license":"CC BY 2.0"}},{"name":"Laguna Colorada","place":"Laguna Colorada","at":[-22.2063,-67.7794],"text":"A red lake with thousands of flamingos, in the Eduardo Avaroa reserve.","source":{"label":"Bikepacking.com: Lagunas y Salares","url":"https://bikepacking.com/routes/lagunas-y-salares/"},"photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a2/Laguna_Colorada_%2815764090609%29.jpg/500px-Laguna_Colorada_%2815764090609%29.jpg","page":"Laguna Colorada","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Laguna_Colorada_%2815764090609%29.jpg","credit":"madras91","license":"CC BY 2.0"}},{"name":"Sol de Mañana","place":"Sol de Mañana","at":[-22.4333,-67.75],"text":"Bubbling mud and steaming vents at almost 5,000 m, the high point.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/29/Sol_de_Ma%C3%B1ana_2018.jpg/500px-Sol_de_Ma%C3%B1ana_2018.jpg","page":"Sol de Mañana","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sol_de_Ma%C3%B1ana_2018.jpg","credit":"kallerna","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}},{"name":"Termas de Polques","place":"Polques hot springs","at":[-22.5333,-67.65],"text":"A hot pool by the salt lake, worth the cold morning.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/39/Vicugna_vicugna_Salar_de_Chalviri.jpg/500px-Vicugna_vicugna_Salar_de_Chalviri.jpg","page":"Salar de Chalviri","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Vicugna_vicugna_Salar_de_Chalviri.jpg","credit":"kallerna","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}},{"name":"Laguna Verde","place":"Laguna Verde","at":[-22.7889,-67.8264],"text":"A green lake under the cone of Licancabur."},{"name":"Hito Cajón","place":"Hito Cajón","at":[-22.9025,-67.7861],"text":"Bolivian exit, then smooth tarmac into Chile.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/12/Licancabur2.jpg/500px-Licancabur2.jpg","page":"Licancabur","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Licancabur2.jpg","credit":"Albert Backer","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0"}},{"name":"San Pedro de Atacama","place":"San Pedro de Atacama, Chile","at":[-23.3545,-67.9027],"text":"A 2,000 m descent into the desert oasis.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/19/San_Pedro_de_Atacama_oasis.jpg/500px-San_Pedro_de_Atacama_oasis.jpg","page":"San Pedro de Atacama","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:San_Pedro_de_Atacama_oasis.jpg","credit":"Pierre cb","license":"Public domain"}}],"legs":[{"by":"ride","km":142,"line":[[-20.4629,-66.8239],[-20.4718,-66.8341],[-20.5151,-66.8001],[-20.5639,-66.8332],[-20.6166,-66.8206],[-20.6591,-66.8077],[-20.7451,-66.7717],[-20.7783,-66.7706],[-20.8065,-66.7636],[-20.8539,-66.7324],[-20.8922,-66.7182],[-20.9031,-66.7586],[-20.9163,-66.7614],[-20.9209,-66.7571],[-20.9292,-66.7627],[-20.9439,-66.7565],[-20.9475,-66.7607],[-21.0218,-66.7527],[-21.022,-66.7647],[-21.0288,-66.7783],[-21.036,-66.7787],[-21.0528,-66.7943],[-21.0622,-66.7958],[-21.0779,-66.7931],[-21.1003,-66.7732],[-21.1197,-66.7674],[-21.1437,-66.7448],[-21.1637,-66.7561],[-21.191,-66.7866],[-21.2054,-66.7961],[-21.2054,-66.8118],[-21.211,-66.8225],[-21.2112,-66.8373],[-21.1951,-66.8803],[-21.1582,-67.0244],[-21.1599,-67.0707],[-21.1522,-67.1008],[-21.1607,-67.1332],[-21.1519,-67.1579],[-21.1537,-67.1662]]},{"by":"ride","km":74,"line":[[-21.1537,-67.1662],[-21.1664,-67.1